<title>USA: In Home Health names von Maack pres, CEO.</title>
<headline>In Home Health names von Maack pres, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>In Home Health Inc named Wolfgang von Maack, who has been serving as acting chief executive, to be president and chief executive.  </p>
<p>Von Maack, who also was elected to the board,  replaces Mark Gildea, who resigned as chief executive and a board member in May.</p>
<p>In Home Health provides health care services to clients of all ages in their homes.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
